    "\tIn consideration of the sum paid by the Purchaser to the Vendor, the Vendor hereby assigns and transfers unto the Purchaser all that piece of land described in the Schedule together with all rights and privileges attached thereto.  The Vendor covenants with the Purchaser that the Vendor has good title to sell the land and that the land is free from encumbrances.\n\tThe Purchaser shall bear the legal costs of and incidental to this assignment on a party-to-party basis.",

