    "\tThe Seller shall deliver the goods in accordance with the quantities and dates specified in the purchase order.  Title and risk in the goods shall pass to the Buyer upon delivery to the designated place.\n\tThe Buyer shall inspect the goods within seven days of delivery and shall notify the Seller of any defect or shortage within that period.\n\tIf no such notice is given, the goods shall be deemed to have been accepted in all respects.",

    "\tThe Option Holder shall have the right, exercisable at any time within the option period, to purchase the shares described in the Schedule at the option price.  The option shall be exercised by written notice accompanied by payment of the option price in full.\n\tIf the option is not exercised within the option period, it shall lapse automatically.\n\tThe parties agree that this agreement does not oblige the Option Holder to exercise the option.",

